 `keyboard_vel_controller.yaml`: hover_wn_xy, hover_zeta_xy, hover_wn_z, hover_zeta_z, dob_L_xy, dob_L_z, hover_throttle, thrust_ratio, uav_weight. ground_station.py is a standalone Python script; the natural way to "
